1
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:06,000
YUM! YUM!

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,240
YUM !וי!

3
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:18,070
וי!

4
00:01:12,320 --> 00:01:14,660
Who are you calling monkey boy, Kaiba?

5
00:01:15,100 --> 00:01:17,394
No one talks like that to Joey Wheeler.

6
00:01:21,900 --> 00:01:22,730
That's right.

7
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,160
Hey, Mai.

8
00:01:27,120 --> 00:01:28,037
Hello, Joey.

9
00:01:28,120 --> 00:01:30,200
I'm glad you're back on your feet.

10
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:32,840
I was freaking out about you. No joke.

11
00:01:33,480 --> 00:01:34,310
Thanks, Joey.

12
00:01:34,420 --> 00:01:37,817
But you've got bigger things to
worry about than little old Mai.

13
00:01:37,900 --> 00:01:39,860
Don't forget me, handsome, okay?

14
00:01:40,260 --> 00:01:41,300
See you later.

15
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:44,640
Mai! Mai!

16
00:01:44,840 --> 00:01:45,760
Come back!

17
00:01:47,060 --> 00:01:47,920
Don't go.

18
00:01:48,300 --> 00:01:49,960
I need you, Mai.

19
00:01:50,420 --> 00:01:53,320
I'll get you back from the Shadow Realm.

20
00:02:09,860 --> 00:02:11,840
It doesn't make any sense!

21
00:02:12,420 --> 00:02:16,600
Somehow I can understand the Egyptian
text on the winged dragon of Ra!

22
00:02:16,940 --> 00:02:19,705
My computer network
couldn't even translate it!

23
00:02:19,880 --> 00:02:22,880
Now, I just need to win it from Marek!

24
00:02:23,960 --> 00:02:25,277
Are you ready?

25
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:30,780
In this shadow duel, the loser will
have to pay the ultimate price.

26
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:36,140
There will be no laughter once I've
banished you to the shadow realm.

27
00:02:36,360 --> 00:02:39,357
You will be the one who's
living in eternal darkness.

28
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:40,300
Wait and see.

29
00:02:41,180 --> 00:02:45,240
This fool has already felt the
wrath of an Egyptian god core.

30
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:51,277
The attack devastated him, so he
was unconscious when I played mine.

31
00:02:51,360 --> 00:02:54,020
Winged Dragon of Ra, attack now!

32
00:02:56,160 --> 00:02:59,877
He completely missed my
demonstration of the unstoppable

33
00:02:59,960 --> 00:03:03,080
powers of the Winged Dragon
of Ra in my last duel.

34
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:08,080
So my opponent has no idea how
my Egyptian god card works.

35
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:12,060
He won't know what to do
when Ra unleashes its rage.

36
00:03:12,420 --> 00:03:13,600
Or will he?

37
00:03:14,040 --> 00:03:15,400
I almost forgot.

38
00:03:15,540 --> 00:03:20,057
You have the dueling experience
of my weaker self to call upon.

39
00:03:20,140 --> 00:03:21,840
That is correct.

40
00:03:22,340 --> 00:03:26,560
And since you've learned everything
you know about dueling from him,

41
00:03:26,880 --> 00:03:30,600
