and your deck inside and out.

42
00:03:30,960 --> 00:03:33,500
Those two are in for quite a surprise.

43
00:03:33,840 --> 00:03:38,300
Once they discover I've changed most
of the cards in my dueling deck.

44
00:03:38,900 --> 00:03:43,437
And don't think I'm unaware of the
Egyptian god card you now hold.

45
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:46,717
Just because that fool
Marek is dueling on your

46
00:03:46,800 --> 00:03:49,860
side doesn't mean you're
safe from the fury of Ra.

47
00:03:50,200 --> 00:03:54,729
For when I'm through with you two, you're
both certain to end up in the dark.

48
00:03:54,860 --> 00:03:55,920
Before we start,

49
00:03:56,240 --> 00:04:00,277
there's someone here who would like to
have a few words with you face to face.

50
00:04:00,360 --> 00:04:01,240
Make it fast.

51
00:04:01,560 --> 00:04:07,000
I will win my body back from you
because destiny is on my side. Sorry,

52
00:04:07,200 --> 00:04:10,840
I've taken over your
destiny now, and with it,

53
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:14,197
I plan to claim the great
power of the Pharaoh for

54
00:04:14,280 --> 00:04:17,240
myself while you two fools
wallow in the shadows.

55
00:04:17,560 --> 00:04:21,220
I won't let you claim my fate
as your own, body snatcher.

56
00:04:22,380 --> 00:04:24,437
I'm afraid it's too late for that.

57
00:04:24,520 --> 00:04:25,877
I am the real you,

58
00:04:25,960 --> 00:04:30,360
and soon you'll be nothing but a
forgotten memory in the sands of time.

59
00:04:31,420 --> 00:04:34,140
While I was occupying Teya's mind,

60
00:04:34,320 --> 00:04:36,957
I heard Ashizu tell the
story of the first day

61
00:04:37,040 --> 00:04:40,820
you were born My brother
Merrick wasn't always evil

62
00:04:41,340 --> 00:04:45,697
She explained that after I received
the Tomb Keeper's initiation,

63
00:04:45,780 --> 00:04:48,917
the seeds of your existence
were planted And it

64
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:52,217
was you who began my path
towards darkness when

65
00:04:52,300 --> 00:04:56,137
you sent my father to the
Shadow Realm Soon you'll

66
00:04:56,220 --> 00:05:00,060
pay for what you did to
me and to him What I did?

67
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:02,240
I was born out of your hate,

68
00:05:02,480 --> 00:05:04,997
your jealousy, and your
anger towards your father,

69
00:05:05,080 --> 00:05:07,320
which makes you just as guilty as me.

70
00:05:07,460 --> 00:05:11,820
That may be, but from now on, I'll
make up for everything I've done.

71
00:05:12,460 --> 00:05:14,820
Father, please forgive me.

72
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:16,540
Very touching.

73
00:05:17,960 --> 00:05:19,700
Now I know the truth.

74
00:05:20,240 --> 00:05:25,860
You have taken your first step, Marek,
on a dangerous path of ultimate darkness.

75
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,277
Now you must turn back
before it's too late.

76
00:05:29,360 --> 00:05:32,480
Soon the pharaoh will return. Turn back.

77
00:05:33,980 --> 00:05:35,937
Odeon shielded me from the truth,

78
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:40,138
and for years I believed it was that
stranger who destroyed my father.

79
00:05:40,400 --> 00:05:42,140
But now I know better.

80
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:44,380
I know it was you.

81
00:05:44,720 --> 00:05:47,717
I'd say you're a little late
to do anything about it.

82
00:05:47,800 --> 00:05:48,660
Not really.

83
00:05:49,100 --> 00:05:52,700
Once this duel's over and you're
gone, revenge will be mine.

84
00:05:53,220 --> 00:05:55,177
Without me, you won't exist.

85
00:05:55,260 --> 00:05:59,320
It appears there are some secrets
that Marek has kept from me.

86
00:05:59,540 --> 00:06:03,300
Now, if he wants my help,
it will cost him dearly.

87
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:09,480
Just stand back and do as I say. Silence.

88
