That's our old deal.

94
00:06:22,300 --> 00:06:23,497
Now I need more.

95
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:27,440
What's that I heard about you
seeking the power of the pharaoh?

96
00:06:27,940 --> 00:06:30,357
Is there a magic stronger
than that of the seven

97
00:06:30,440 --> 00:06:33,264
millennium items that you
haven't told me about?

98
00:06:33,500 --> 00:06:37,000
I want to know what secrets
you're keeping from me, Marek.

99
00:06:37,240 --> 00:06:39,600
Tell me everything and we have a deal.

100
00:06:39,900 --> 00:06:42,080
If we win, I'll tell you all.

101
00:06:42,200 --> 00:06:43,280
Then let's begin.

102
00:06:43,760 --> 00:06:47,400
I don't trust you at all, but
this time I know you need me.

103
00:06:47,560 --> 00:06:48,640
Then let's duel!

104
00:06:48,900 --> 00:06:50,697
You heard your better half, you fiend.

105
00:06:50,780 --> 00:06:53,920
Now prepare for a one-way
trip to the Shadow Realm.

106
00:06:55,060 --> 00:06:57,060
Seems you're a bit confused.

107
00:06:57,500 --> 00:07:00,197
I'm going to bring the
darkness of the Shadow Realm

108
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:03,680
