consume you piece by piece.

109
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,560
Blackness, surround us.

110
00:07:07,780 --> 00:07:10,540
Prepare for a battle like no other.

111
00:07:10,820 --> 00:07:12,060
For in this duel,

112
00:07:12,240 --> 00:07:14,837
