115
00:07:19,700 --> 00:07:22,500
Just wait and see. Very well.

116
00:07:22,780 --> 00:07:23,680
Let's duel.

117
00:07:27,620 --> 00:07:30,560
And now, let the destruction commence.

118
00:07:32,040 --> 00:07:35,900
