127
00:08:04,200 --> 00:08:07,141
You've activated my trap
card, Fearful Earthbound!

128
00:08:08,100 --> 00:08:08,930
No!

129
00:08:09,820 --> 00:08:11,740
Yes, your first mistake.

130
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:14,400
Your first of many.

131
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:16,057
What's the point of this?

132
00:08:16,140 --> 00:08:19,537
I knew you wouldn't be able
to resist attacking my zombie,

133
00:08:19,620 --> 00:08:24,502
and now I'm going to punish you for your
fatal error by weakening your life points.

134
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,482
When this trap card's activated,

135
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:29,417
the opposing duelist
automatically loses 500

136
00:08:29,500 --> 00:08:32,440
life points each time his monster attacks.

137
00:08:32,600 --> 00:08:33,460
Like now.

138
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:37,160
I'm still sending your
monster to the graveyard.

139
00:08:37,540 --> 00:08:40,837
Feel free to destroy my weak
monsters whenever you want.

140
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:45,797
Not only will you lose life points, but
with each monster you send to the graveyard,

141
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:46,960
I grow stronger.

142
00:08:51,940 --> 00:08:55,017
And now you will feel
the effect of my fearful

143
00:08:55,100 --> 00:08:58,600
earthbound as it lowers
your life points by 500.

144
00:09:01,220 --> 00:09:03,380
Really? Guess again. What?

145
00:09:03,780 --> 00:09:05,860
I activate remove trap.

146
00:09:13,380 --> 00:09:17,000
My magic card has eliminated
your pathetic trap.

147
00:09:17,340 --> 00:09:20,340
It'll take more than a
magic card to beat me.

148
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:25,180
That may be true, but from the looks
of your arm, it's a start. My arm?

149
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:31,880
Looks like you're the one
who's about to disappear.

150
00:09:32,440 --> 00:09:34,420
What have you done to my body?

151
00:09:34,720 --> 00:09:35,820
It's vanishing.

152
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:39,017
Obviously, you weren't listening
to what I said earlier.

153
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:39,930
Remember,

154
00:09:40,100 --> 00:09:43,860
you just lost 500 life
points And as they fade away,

155
00:09:44,120 --> 00:09:46,657
so will small portions of your body Until

156
00:09:46,740 --> 00:09:49,960
