all of you You fiend

157
00:09:50,660 --> 00:09:54,820
Soon the darkness will feed
on your soul for all eternity

158
00:09:58,020 --> 00:10:02,060
I'm quite familiar with how the
Shadow Realm operates Besides,

159
00:10:02,360 --> 00:10:06,280
it is you who shall disappear
into the darkness Don't be a fool

160
