162
00:10:13,320 --> 00:10:18,000
You're wrong, for with the help of your
other half, I will certainly prevail.

163
00:10:18,440 --> 00:10:21,087
Only fools rely on the
help of the desperate.

164
00:10:22,020 --> 00:10:23,940
Just wait, you'll see.

165
00:10:41,060 --> 00:10:42,200
Where am I?

166
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:46,320
This stuff looks familiar, but
where have I seen it before?

167
00:10:50,460 --> 00:10:51,580
Wait a sec!

168
00:10:51,880 --> 00:10:54,100
This is the inside of my mind!

169
00:10:54,440 --> 00:10:56,800
And that's the door to Yami's side!

170
00:10:58,280 --> 00:11:01,900
I've been in there once before,
and it was really dangerous.

171
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:05,359
But maybe I can find some
clues to the ancient past.

172
00:11:06,280 --> 00:11:07,110
Whoa!

173
00:11:07,193 --> 00:11:08,349
Talk about a complex mind!

174
00:11:08,540 --> 00:11:11,037
