this many levels before.

175
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:13,944
There are false starts
and dead ends everywhere.

176
00:11:14,220 --> 00:11:15,520
Something wrong, Yugi?

177
00:11:15,760 --> 00:11:17,280
Sorry if I disturbed you.

178
00:11:17,460 --> 00:11:20,597
Your mind must have been restless
to have brought you here.

179
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:22,540
I guess I am a little worried.

180
00:11:23,520 --> 00:11:24,640
Yes, of course.

181
00:11:24,900 --> 00:11:26,457
Tell me, what's on your mind?

182
00:11:26,540 --> 00:11:31,297
Hmm, it seems like things are getting out
of hand lately, and the danger's growing.

183
00:11:31,380 --> 00:11:32,210
That's true.

184
00:11:32,320 --> 00:11:34,097
It grows as we near our destiny.

185
00:11:34,180 --> 00:11:37,680
So that's why I'm starting
to understand this place.

186
00:11:37,940 --> 00:11:40,160
I think I know why it's so complex.

187
00:11:41,380 --> 00:11:43,400
All these confusing paths,

188
00:11:43,620 --> 00:11:46,637
