mysteries of your past

189
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:49,544
and all the questions you
have about the future.

190
00:11:49,880 --> 00:11:50,710
That's right.

191
00:11:51,900 --> 00:11:55,340
Yami, I know we're going to
figure all of this out soon.

192
00:11:55,560 --> 00:11:58,442
And I'm not going to let
anyone stand in our way.

193
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,960
You may have struck first.

194
00:12:04,180 --> 00:12:06,000
But I'll have the last laugh.

195
00:12:06,400 --> 00:12:10,040
And the joke will be on you. Now then.

196
00:12:11,060 --> 00:12:14,060
It doesn't matter which
card you play next.

197
00:12:14,300 --> 00:12:18,520
I know your deck very well, and
none of your moves will surprise me.

198
00:12:18,940 --> 00:12:21,600
Remember, I witnessed your last tool.

199
00:12:22,920 --> 00:12:25,100
If he's familiar with my cards,

200
00:12:25,300 --> 00:12:28,937
