destiny board as I did last time.

201
00:12:29,020 --> 00:12:31,420
But I'm afraid he's in for a surprise.

202
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:33,557
Stalling won't help him.

203
00:12:33,640 --> 00:12:36,457
It will just delay the
appearance of my winged

204
00:12:36,540 --> 00:12:39,360
dragon of Ra and his assured destruction.

205
00:12:40,820 --> 00:12:41,840
I'm waiting.

206
00:12:42,560 --> 00:12:44,120
Anxious to lose, are we?

207
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:46,740
He has only one monster on the field,

208
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:49,817
so even if the winged dragon
of Ra is already in his hand,

209
00:12:49,900 --> 00:12:51,080
I still have time.

210
00:12:51,220 --> 00:12:55,960
For he must sacrifice three monsters
before he can summon his Egyptian god card.

211
00:12:56,280 --> 00:12:59,040
Ra is no threat. Trust me. Keep quiet.

212
00:12:59,320 --> 00:13:00,317
I have a plan.

213
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,860
Don't be a fool.

214
00:13:02,180 --> 00:13:04,780
In my mind lies the secret of Ra.

215
00:13:05,120 --> 00:13:07,040
Give it to me. Let's go.

216
00:13:07,320 --> 00:13:10,177
You can argue when you're
both in the Shadow Realm.

217
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:13,377
Believe me, whatever you're
planning won't work anyway.

218
00:13:13,460 --> 00:13:14,578
Thanks for the tip.

219
00:13:14,820 --> 00:13:16,055
That just might work.

220
00:13:16,800 --> 00:13:21,520
You do realize that the scheme you just
told me works, and we defeat this demon,

221
00:13:21,780 --> 00:13:24,015
you may lose your body in the process.

222
00:13:24,220 --> 00:13:25,820
I'll risk it. Now go.

223
00:13:26,620 --> 00:13:28,180
Let them conspire.

224
00:13:28,320 --> 00:13:29,937
It won't do them any good.

225
00:13:30,020 --> 00:13:36,020
I'll place two cards face down, and
I'll summon Garnia in defense mode.

226
00:13:36,600 --> 00:13:38,700
Just try to tear him down.

227
00:13:39,060 --> 00:13:41,160
What's he trying to do now?

228
00:13:41,580 --> 00:13:42,780
Not that it matters.

229
00:13:43,060 --> 00:13:46,040
My Egyptian god card will
defeat him regardless.

230
00:13:46,480 --> 00:13:50,680
That is, once I draw the weak
dragon of Ra into my hand.

231
00:13:50,980 --> 00:13:52,200
It's my move.

232
00:13:53,220 --> 00:13:54,050
Excellent.

233
00:13:54,133 --> 00:13:56,414
This card will help me get what I need.

234
00:13:56,840 --> 00:13:59,500
I activate the card of sanctity.

235
00:14:00,460 --> 00:14:05,937
what does your magic card do simple
we must keep drawing until we both

236
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:08,557
hold six cards this should help me

237
00:14:08,640 --> 00:14:13,997
immensely no sounds to me like you didn't

238
00:14:14,080 --> 00:14:18,317
draw what you needed fortunately I
can give you one more chance at it

239
00:14:18,400 --> 00:14:24,400
that is if you don't mind my help open
face down card multiple destruction

240
00:14:26,720 --> 00:14:28,140
What does that do?

241
00:14:28,360 --> 00:14:32,417
My trap card forces both players to
discard their hands to the graveyard,

242
00:14:32,500 --> 00:14:35,860
