new cards from our dex.

243
00:14:36,200 --> 00:14:39,137
Of course, there is a
downside to playing this card.

244
00:14:39,220 --> 00:14:44,680
The duelist who uses it loses 100 life
points for each card he throws away.

245
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:48,340
Is this a trick?

246
00:14:48,620 --> 00:14:50,520
Why is he destroying himself?

247
00:14:51,340 --> 00:14:52,740
Who's stalling now?

248
00:14:52,980 --> 00:14:53,880
It's your move.

249
00:14:56,820 --> 00:14:58,580
Still no winged dragon.

250
00:14:58,800 --> 00:14:59,980
